Copyright The Apache Software Foundation and is licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0; a copy of that license is included at
src/local_spark_mcp/winutils/LICENSE-2.0.txt, and file hashes and provenance
are recorded in src/local_spark_mcp/winutils/PROVENANCE.md.

The Scala jar at src/local_spark_mcp/jars/ (ch.fs.HttpTokenProvider,
ch.fs.OneLakeCatalog) is original to this project.
